            "top_image_width": 100,
            "text_color": "text-dark",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Trusted Grass Seed Experts Serving Glenwood Springs for 35 Years",
            "text": "<p>Choosing the right grass seed in Glenwood Springs can be tricky with our dry summers, clay-like soil, and mix of full sun and shaded areas. We hear a lot of questions about how to get a green lawn in Colorado or what seed holds up best through the growing season. </p><p>Rivendell Distribution built a collection that includes cool season grasses,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Native+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> drought tolerant natives</a>, and<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Pasture+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> blends for pastures</a>,<a href=\"https://www.rivendelldistribution.com/collections/grass-seeds?sort_by=best-selling&filter.p.tag=Turf+Grass\" target=\"_blank\"> sports fields</a>, and high traffic yards. Each mix is selected to work with local soil conditions and the changing seasons across the Western Slope. We’re a family-owned business here to help you grow a healthy lawn that fits your yard, your schedule, and your soil.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary btn--small",
            "bg_color": ""
          }
        }
